      861   define temp-table tt-utd like ub.utd
      862     field stts        as character
      863     field stts-edi    as character
      864     field cli-name    as character
      865     field EDoTypeName as character
      866     field ModifyTime_ as character
      867     field orig-code   as character
      868     field GrayZone    as logical
      869     field obj-name    as character
      870     field is-initial  as character
      871     field scan-qnty   as decimal
      872     field free-qnty   as decimal
      873     .
